#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:45
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Popis"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:46
msgid ""
"This effect relies on (SAM2)\\ [1]_ object segmentation. Its purpose is to "
"isolate an object in images or videos like rotoscoping."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt sa spolieha na segmentáciu objektov (SAM2)\\ [1]_. Jeho účelom "
"je izolovať objekt v obrázkoch alebo videách podobne ako rotoskopia."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:48
msgid ""
"Before Object Mask can be used, it must be properly configured and models "
"installed. Please refer to the chapter :doc:`Configure Object Detection</"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."
msgstr ""
"Pred použitím masky objektu musí byť správne nakonfigurovaná a nainštalované "
"modely. Pozrite sa na kapitolu :doc:`Configure Object Detection</"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:50
msgid "The effect works only on the selected clips in the project bin."
msgstr "Efekt funguje iba na vybraných klipoch v zásobníku projektu."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:52
msgid "There are two ways to use Object Mask:"
msgstr "Existujú dva spôsoby použitia masky objektu:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:58
msgid "Object Mask in the effect stack when a clip is selected"
msgstr "Maska objektu v zásobníku efektov keď je vybratý klip"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:62
msgid "Click on |create-object-mask| :guilabel:`Create an Object mask`"
msgstr "Kliknite na |create-object-mask| :guilabel:`Create an Object mask`"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:63
msgid "Use :guilabel:`Remove Background` when the built-in effects are enabled"
msgstr "Použite :guilabel:`Remove Background` keď sú povolené vstavané efekty"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:66
msgid "Steps to create an Object Mask"
msgstr "Kroky na vytvorenie masky objektu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:73
msgid "Add a clip to the project bin"
msgstr "Pridajte klip do zásobníka projektu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:74
msgid ""
"Select in the clip monitor a zone by setting in/out points **(3)** where the "
"background should be removed"
msgstr ""
"Vyberte v monitore klipu zónu nastavením vstupných/výstupných bodov **(3)** "
"kde má byť pozadie odstránené"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:75
msgid ""
"Click on |create-object-mask| :guilabel:`Create an Object mask` or :guilabel:"
"`Remove Background`"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na |create-object-mask| :guilabel:`Create an Object mask` alebo :"
"guilabel:`Remove Background`"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:83
msgid "click on |list-add| :guilabel:`Create New Mask` **(4)**"
msgstr "kliknite na |list-add| :guilabel:`Create New Mask` **(4)**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:84
msgid ""
"Click in the clip monitor to select an object by either dragging a rectangle "
"**(5)** and :kbd:`LMB` **(6)** to define the object inside the rectangle or "
"by :kbd:`Shift+click` **(6)** to add another part, or :kbd:`CTRL+click` to "
"exclude a zone"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite v monitore klipu na výber objektu buď potiahnutím obdĺžnika **(5)** "
"a :kbd:`LMB` **(6)** na definovanie objektu vo vnútri obdĺžnika alebo "
"pomocou :kbd:`Shift+click` **(6)** na pridanie ďalšej časti, alebo :kbd:`CTRL"
"+click` na vylúčenie zóny"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:85
msgid ""
"The mask can be inverted |edit-select-invert| **(7)** or the opacity |edit-"
"opacity| **(8)** of the mask can be changed in 25% steps"
msgstr ""
"Masku je možné invertovať |edit-select-invert| **(7)** alebo nepriehľadnosť |"
"edit-opacity| **(8)** masky je možné meniť po krokoch 25 %"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:86
msgid "Click on |media-record| :guilabel:`Generate Mask` **(9)**"
msgstr "Kliknite na |media-record| :guilabel:`Generate Mask` **(9)**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:87
msgid "Wait until the mask is generated."
msgstr "Počkajte, kým sa maska vygeneruje."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:88
msgid "The process can be canceled by clicking on the minus icon **(10)**"
msgstr "Proces je možné zrušiť kliknutím na ikonu mínus **(10)**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:96
msgid "Once the mask is created, select it **(11)**"
msgstr "Po vytvorení masky ju vyberte **(11)**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:97
msgid "You can preview the mask **(12)** or edit the mask **(13)** as you like"
msgstr ""
"Môžete si prezrieť masku **(12)** alebo upraviť masku **(13)** podľa svojich "
"predstáv"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Apply Mask` **(14)** opens the effect :doc:`Shape Alpha</"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/shape_alpha_mask>` and "
"the mask get applied"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Apply Mask` **(14)** otvorí efekt :doc:`Shape Alpha</"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/shape_alpha_mask>` a "
"maska sa použije"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:99
msgid ""
"You can |edit-delete| delete the selected mask **(16)** or you can |document-"
"import| import the mask **(15)** into the project bin as a new clip"
msgstr ""
"Môžete |edit-delete| odstrániť vybranú masku **(16)** alebo môžete |document-"
"import| importovať masku **(15)** do zásobníka projektu ako nový klip"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:100
msgid "Right click on the mask **(11)** and you can open the containing folder"
msgstr ""
"Kliknite pravým tlačidlom myši na masku **(11)** a môžete otvoriť priečinok, "
"ktorý ju obsahuje"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/alpha_mask_keying/object_mask.rst:115
msgid ""
"For more details about this effect refer to the github entry about |"
"facebookresearch_sam2|."
msgstr ""
"Ďalšie podrobnosti o tomto efekte nájdete v zázname na githube o |"
"facebookresearch_sam2|."
